{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30277","headline":"送沈单作尉江都 · 薛逢","name":"送沈单作尉江都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炀帝都城春水边，笙歌夜上木兰船。\n三千宫女自涂地，十万人家如洞天。\n焰焰花枝官舍晚，重重云影寺墙连。\n少年作尉须矜慎，莫向楼前坠马鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}